| **CORS restrictions** | Prevent unintended cross‑origin requests. | Implicitly open (no `Access‑Control‑Allow‑Origin`). | If the API is not public, configure: <br>`app.use(cors({origin: 'https://your‑frontend.example.com'}));` |
