- [ ] Update `package.json` and lock file; run `npm audit`.
- [ ] Consider **authentication** for the `/users` route.
- [ ] Deploy behind **HTTPS** (TLS termination).
- [ ] Set up CI to run **dependency audit** on every PR.

Implementing the above changes will transform this minimal demo into a production‑ready, security‑hardened Express service. If you need help wiring any of the suggested libraries or setting up CI pipelines, just let me know!

